{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391","id":5175811911,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABNICfRw","number":391,"title":"Two cow-manure records with opposite grades; one holds an ENVO id it grades BROAD_MATCH against","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-17T21:58:57Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T02:10:32Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T02:10:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found while reviewing SSSOM delivery.\n\nTwo records for cow manure, both with 0 occurrences, both pointing at `ENVO:00003031 \"animal manure\"` — with **opposite** quality grades for the same relationship:\n\n```\n[mapped  ] Dry cow-manure   id=ENVO:00003031   MAPPED     quality=BROAD_MATCH\n[unmapped] Cow manure       id=UNMAPPED_0367   UNMAPPED   quality=NARROW_MATCH\n```\n\nThree separate problems:\n\n1. **They are duplicates.** \"Dry cow-manure\" and \"Cow manure\" are the same material modulo a preparation detail.\n2. **The grades contradict.** Cow manure cannot be both broader and narrower than animal manure. It is narrower.\n3. **`Dry cow-manure` holds `ENVO:00003031` as its identifier while grading BROAD_MATCH.** In MIM the identifier IS the ontology CURIE for a mapped record, so it claims to *be* animal manure while its grade says it is not. Per `MAPPING_SEMANTICS` §3, a record narrower than every available term should carry a registry mint.\n\n`Cow manure` is also `UNMAPPED` while carrying a populated `ontology_mapping`, which is its own inconsistency.\n\n## No more specific ontology term exists\n\nChecked before proposing a mint — `cow manure` returns nothing in ENVO/AGRO/FOODON, and `ENVO:01001116 \"bovine dairy liquid manure\"` is **liquid**, the opposite of \"dry\". So §3 step 1 does not apply and step 3 (mint) is the right instrument.\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nMerge the two into one record, mint `kgmicrobe.ingredient:dry_cow_manure` (or `cow_manure`), and emit the asymmetric row to ENVO:00003031 in whichever direction #the SKOS-direction issue settles on. Both have 0 occurrences, so this is low-risk.\n\nNot done in the SSSOM-delivery PR because it is a merge plus a mint plus a direction decision, and that PR was scoped to the single row that lands backwards downstream.\n","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/391/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}